  "_repository_comment": "`litlfred/folio-assistant`, not `litlfred/qou` with `directory: folio-assistant`. That was the pre-split layout, where this package was a subdirectory of the folio; it has been its own repository since, and the stale value pointed a consumer at a repo that does not contain it. Same class as every other defect in bean `frq2`: a literal that travelled at the split with its text unchanged.",
